OL,3,AOasis: Don't Look Back In Anger review
OL,4,A- emotional documentary glosses over
OL,5,Athe hard stuff
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn an opening montage, we hear how
OL,8,FOasis conquered the world in the 1990s
OL,9,Fwith hits like Wonderwall and Roll With
OL,10,FIt. As their fame grew, so did the
OL,11,Fbrothers' animosity, until the party
OL,12,Fcame to an abrupt halt backstage at a
OL,13,Fgig in Paris in 2009.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
